 "description": "Freddie Mac Primary Mortgage Market Survey \u2014 the weekly US mortgage INTEREST rate (the annual percentage borrowers pay on a home loan, e.g. 6.5%), back to 1971. This is the borrowing cost paid by home buyers. Returns the latest snapshot, a time series for the requested window, and min/max/avg stats. Sourced from Freddie Mac directly (not FRED), ingested weekly by the Pipeworx data pipeline.",
